<chapter xml:id="ch04_reactive_navigation_obstacle_avoidance" xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude">
  <title>Reactive Navigation &amp; Obstacle Avoidance</title>
  <introduction>
    <p>This chapter focuses on fast, local decision-making for safe robot motion. You will study reactive strategies that respond directly to sensor data without requiring a complete global map. The material emphasizes obstacle avoidance, collision risk, and behavior under uncertainty. These methods are especially useful in dynamic environments where conditions change quickly.</p>
  </introduction>
